Separately run software (ADR-0011 decision 4)
---------------------------------------------
Nothing below is distributed with this product; each runs as its own process or service.
- ansible-core (GPL-3.0-or-later), installed by the optional `ansible` extra to run the role
  tests and deploys as `ansible-playbook`. No module under homelabnext/ imports it. The Ansible
  plugins under ansible/plugins/ subclass its classes and run only inside it; they are
  Apache-2.0, which GPL-3.0 can combine with.
- Container images and services that roles, compose files and provider modules deploy keep
  their own licences, some of them copyleft (the lab-in-a-box object store image is
  AGPL-3.0). A provider module records its product's licence in `licence.spdx`.
